  認識主角：一個 Harness 裡有哪些控制
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

💡 Harness 不是一道護欄，而是一組控制平面：身分、意圖、上下文、記憶、執行期、工具閘道、資料治理。再發一張短期憑證，看它綁定對象之後，拿去別的地方用會怎樣。

▶ 要執行的程式：
  │ from harnesslab.core import Harness, default_tools
  │ h = Harness()
  │ print("Harness 的控制元件：")
  │ for name in ("broker", "intent", "context", "memory", "runtime", "gateway", "governance"):
  │     print("  " + name.ljust(11) + "→ " + type(getattr(h, name)).__name__)
  │ print("\n工具閘道已登記的工具：")
  │ for t in default_tools():
  │     classes = sorted(d.value for d in t.data_classes)
  │     print("  " + t.name.ljust(20) + "風險=" + t.risk.value.ljust(23) + "可回復=" + str(t.reversible).ljust(6) + "資料=" + str(classes))
  │ print("\n對外白名單：", sorted(h.governance.egress_allowlist))
  │ cred = h.broker.issue(subject="agent-deployer-01", audience="harnesslab-control-plane", ttl_seconds=3600, delegation_chain=("course-admin", "agent-deployer-01"))
  │ print("\n發給 agent-deployer-01 的短期憑證，委派鏈：", cred.delegation_chain)
  │ for aud in ("harnesslab-control-plane", "prod-deploy-api"):
  │     d = h.broker.verify(cred, aud)
  │     print("  拿去用在 " + aud.ljust(26) + "→ " + d.decision.value.upper().ljust(6) + d.reason)
▶ 執行結果：
Harness 的控制元件：
  broker     → CredentialBroker
  intent     → IntentVerifier
  context    → ContextFirewall
  memory     → MemoryFirewall
  runtime    → RuntimeController
  gateway    → ToolGateway
  governance → DataGovernanceEngine

工具閘道已登記的工具：
  read_ticket         風險=read                   可回復=True  資料=['internal', 'pii', 'public']
  patch_repo          風險=reversible_write       可回復=True  資料=['internal', 'public']
  deploy_service      風險=privileged_operation   可回復=False 資料=['internal']
  send_customer_email 風險=external_communication 可回復=False 資料=['internal', 'pii', 'public']
  query_vault         風險=privileged_operation   可回復=False 資料=['secret']
  write_memory        風險=reversible_write       可回復=True  資料=['internal', 'pii', 'public']
  emit_trace          風險=read                   可回復=True  資料=['confidential', 'internal', 'public']

對外白名單： ['approved-siem', 'internal-repo', 'internal-ticketing', 'training-console']

發給 agent-deployer-01 的短期憑證，委派鏈： ('course-admin', 'agent-deployer-01')
  拿去用在 harnesslab-control-plane  → ALLOW credential valid
  拿去用在 prod-deploy-api           → DENY  credential audience mismatch

