query_vault         ALLOW     DENY     tool query_vault is outside approved purpose  ← 閘道放行、合約擋下
deploy_service      ALLOW     DENY     tool deploy_service is outside approved purpose  ← 閘道放行、合約擋下
send_customer_email ALLOW     DENY     tool send_customer_email is outside approved purpose  ← 閘道放行、合約擋下

