  工具閘道 → ALLOW    tool gateway accepted call

漏報：意圖寫壞事但含關鍵字
  意圖合約 → ALLOW    intent contract satisfied
  工具閘道 → ALLOW    tool gateway accepted call

謊報副作用：寫入說成讀取
  意圖合約 → ALLOW    intent contract satisfied
  工具閘道 → ESCALATE declared side effect differs from tool registration

